        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Framework Transition and Traffic Impact",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "framework_transition_and_traffic_impact",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Medibody's shift to using frameworks for page creation aims to reduce tech dependency, allowing quicker, more flexible SEO adjustments. However, this move has led to initial traffic declines, particularly on medicine pages.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "c6b25c3b-31b4-438e-9afe-fb3f17fe594d",
                    "time": 280.875,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Recent traffic declines on medicine pages need addressing. The transition has led to challenges with SEO visibility due to subdomain usage.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "fcb4e586-0f27-448a-821d-a125539b0ee1",
                    "time": 322.97,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Develop strategy to improve traffic on new framework pages, focusing on integrating SEO best practices and leveraging structured data to regain visibility. Collaborate with Thinkbyte.ai to refine content strategy and execution.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "8f4e8db6-e0fa-4917-9034-53f7fa9ea143",
                    "time": 878.29504,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "framework_transition_and_traffic_impact",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "SEO and Digital Marketing Product Development",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "seo_and_digital_marketing_product_development",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Medibody faces challenges maintaining SEO traffic due to recent shifts, including framework adjustments and traffic declines on medicine-related pages. The transition to subdomains for certain pages has impacted visibility and necessitated more strategic SEO efforts.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "6390e71d-b7db-49c6-99b5-41cfe5083732",
                    "time": 322.97,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte.ai is developing an SEO product as part of a broader digital marketing strategy. This product focuses on identifying content gaps, optimizing existing content, and leveraging structured data for better search engine performance. It aims to help companies improve their SEO efforts by suggesting keyword clusters, creating content plans, and monitoring performance.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "f0e71105-11aa-44f0-ad8b-f1d9a8a00bcf",
                    "time": 878.29504,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The product will include features like hierarchical keyword clustering and content planning, which will help Medibody align its SEO strategies with business goals. This includes focusing on high-value content categories and addressing both informational and commercial intent traffic.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "0657b627-52af-4f42-af74-0e83eebd353c",
                    "time": 878.29504,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "seo_and_digital_marketing_product_development",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Content Automation and Optimization",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "content_automation_and_optimization",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The product aims to automate content creation and optimization using AI, ensuring content aligns with identified keyword clusters and market opportunities. The tool will generate content outlines and suggest optimizations based on competitor analysis and user intent data.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "bd867f6b-3ace-4217-816b-90f3a2385a60",
                    "time": 878.29504,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Need balance between automated content creation and human oversight avoid keyword stuffing, maintain content quality. Ensuring content is humanized and meets business goals is critical to success.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "6cff3b1d-8092-4835-8260-71a650812ee8",
                    "time": 2884.9702,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Integrate user input in content planning and prioritize humanization of AI-generated content. Develop system where AI provides suggestions and human editors refine output to meet quality standards.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "0e6dd3b6-c95c-4b52-8c32-1e14228aa2bf",
                    "time": 2884.9702,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "content_automation_and_optimization",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Humanization and Monitoring of AI Content",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "humanization_and_monitoring_of_ai_content",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Implement humanization scores, task systems for quality control, leveraging human editors for final content adjustments. This ensures content remains relevant and engaging while meeting SEO objectives.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "9903e575-5a1b-4681-8c30-ad6ac18abc5c",
                    "time": 951.84,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Emphasis on humanizing AI-generated content to ensure quality, relevance. This involves using human editors refine AI outputs, supported by a system tracks content quality metrics.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "9715f427-7e9d-4916-80c6-67c2c0bbd7f2",
                    "time": 2884.9702,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Ensuring AI content meets human quality standards, aligns with business goals is crucial to maintaining content authenticity, effectiveness.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "163c9900-da1a-4a43-8619-2d479b1b4bad",
                    "time": 2945.27,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "unordered-list",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "humanization_and_monitoring_of_ai_content",
            "highlight_notes_list": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Integration with Google Search Console and Analytics",
              "object": "text"
            }
          ],
          "object": "block",
          "type": "header-2",
          "data": {
            "block_key": "integration_with_google_search_console_and_analytics",
            "highlight_notes_title": true,
            "machine_title": true
          }
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Current lack of integration hinders ability to closely monitor performance, adjust strategies dynamically. This gap limits effectiveness of automated suggestions and requires manual oversight.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "d151e76e-88b6-4cf6-87ae-0224cdd0d3ab",
                    "time": 1604.0149,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Integration with Google Search Console and Analytics planned for performance tracking, goal monitoring, data-driven insights. This integration will facilitate continuous monitoring, adjustments to SEO strategies based on real-time data.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "ac8e8dcb-a402-4aab-8532-9c63ff2b5080",
                    "time": 2566.68,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Integrate platforms enhance data-driven decision-making, enable automated performance monitoring, allowing dynamic response to traffic changes and competitor actions.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
